<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>May my mind be filled with His light,</l><l>May my spirit be shining so bright,</l><l>May His life bear much fruit,</l><l>May I be absolute,</l><l>To partake of the living Christ.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
